Ported code (same author)
-------------------------
Parts of pipeline/ are ports of modules from scalendarii (a calendar
aggregator by the same author, AGPL-3.0-or-later): the HTML-to-text
helpers, the fetcher's capped read and encoding sniff, the private-address
guard, the iCal / WordPress The Events Calendar / Gancio / JSON-LD / RSS
adapters and the source detection ladder. Parts of site/ and scripts/ are
ports of calqrii (GPL-3.0-or-later, same author): the iCalendar escaping and
line folding, the zoned wall-clock conversion, the month grid, the web-smoke
gate and the browser-gate CDP client. The author relicenses these ports
under GPL-3.0-or-later for this project.

Third-party runtime dependency (pipeline only, never shipped to the browser)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ical.js (https://github.com/kewisch/ical.js), used unmodified as an npm
dependency under the Mozilla Public License 2.0
(https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/). Its source is available from the npm
registry and the repository above.

Data
----
Event data under site/data/ is collected from the clubs' own published
calendars and from bonn.jetzt; every event links back to its source. The
listed clubs and platforms keep all rights to their content.
